00:01:06.916 --> 00:01:09.396
PROFESSOR: [UNINTELLIGIBLE].

00:01:09.396 --> 00:01:09.892
OK.

00:01:09.892 --> 00:01:11.380
You guys have kind of
a [UNINTELLIGIBLE].

00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:18.470
AUDIENCE: And how do you
