AUDIENCE: Yeah.

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:24.812
It's a path building game
involving family members.

00:01:24.812 --> 00:01:26.650
AUDIENCE: Consider it geneology
path building.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:29.100
AUDIENCE: It's kind of like
a Family Feud game.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.940
Except, it's a little
bit stranger.

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:38.555
PROFESSOR: So I think
Jay and Mia.

00:01:38.555 --> 00:01:39.030
AUDIENCE: Yeah.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:40.455
[UNINTELLIGIBLE PHRASE]

00:01:40.455 --> 00:01:42.840
PROFESSOR: And Calvin and
Jason, you've been

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:44.613
[UNINTELLIGIBLE] in that.

00:01:44.613 --> 00:01:45.016
AUDIENCE: Oh.

00:01:45.016 --> 00:01:45.580
[UNINTELLIGIBLE]

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:47.412
and things.

00:01:47.412 --> 00:01:49.806
AUDIENCE: [UNINTELLIGIBLE].

00:01:49.806 --> 00:01:52.800
PROFESSOR: So right now we
have a-- we don't have a

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:53.195
