00:33:10.964 --> 00:33:15.428
That's another good
opportunity to win

00:33:15.428 --> 00:33:15.924
[UNINTELLIGIBLE].

00:33:15.924 --> 00:33:18.280
But know what problem you're
trying to solve before you're

00:33:18.280 --> 00:33:19.396
throwing something away.

00:33:19.396 --> 00:33:23.020
Because sometimes you can have
a lot of fun with games that

00:33:23.020 --> 00:33:25.616
are effectively just
like fun butteries.

00:33:25.616 --> 00:33:27.035
You know, oh, I draw a card.

00:33:27.035 --> 00:33:28.875
Munchkin is kind of like
