00:33:28.875 --> 00:33:29.390
You draw a card.

00:33:29.390 --> 00:33:31.190
Oh, look at, funny.

00:33:31.190 --> 00:33:32.330
And you read the text.

00:33:32.330 --> 00:33:33.520
That was silly.

00:33:33.520 --> 00:33:36.030
And now they've added a Twitter
version of Munchkin

00:33:36.030 --> 00:33:38.930
where every hour you introduce
